URW Core 35 Fonts Attribution
-----------------------------

The Standard 14 substitution fonts for the Times, Helvetica and Courier families are derived from the URW Core 35 fonts, Version 2.00 - Nimbus Roman, Nimbus Sans and Nimbus Mono PS respectively:

    Copyright 2014, 2015 by (URW)++ Design & Development

URW++ offers Version 2.00 under a choice of three licenses: the GNU Affero General Public License Version 3 with a font-embedding exemption, the LaTeX Project Public License Version 1.3c, and the SIL Open Font License Version 1.1. This project uses these fonts under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1 alone, which the URW++ release carries with no Reserved Font Name. A copy of that license is included next to the fonts it covers, as 'PdfPixel.Fonts/Resources/Standard14Fonts/LICENSE.OFL'.

The source fonts are cloned from 'https://github.com/twardoch/urw-core35-fonts' when 'PdfPixel.ResourceGenerator' generates the Standard14Fonts section; they are not held in this repository.

These fonts are modified. Each is subset to the glyphs its corresponding Adobe AFM names, the advance width of every retained glyph is replaced with the width that AFM states scaled into the font's em square, and the 'name' table is replaced with a PdfPixel family name so that the result is not presented under the URW++ names. Each font states the copyright notice above and its license in its own 'name' table.

As the SIL Open Font License requires, these font files remain licensed under that license, modified or unmodified, and are not covered by the MIT License that applies to the rest of this repository. That requirement does not extend to any document produced with them.


